  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "電腦視覺與擴增實境",
    "sub_ename": "COMPUTER VISION AND AUGMENTED REALITY",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在介紹不同的電腦視覺演算法，以及結合擴增實境後的各種應用。課程內容包含特徵點擷取、圖像辨識和環境重建，帶領學生了解電腦視覺如何感知現實環境，並實作出能與現實互動的應用程式。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces different computer vision algorithms, and the applications related to Augmented Reality. The topics mainly covers feature extraction, image recognition and environment reconstruction. After taking this course, students will know how computers sense the real world and have the ability to implement Augmented Reality applications which can interact with environments.",
